// THE 26317 CHANGE - THE SCENE-WITNESS READ (default, code 6):
//   Membership: |resolved scene depth at Q  -  this fragment's OWN window z
//   extrapolated to Q| within tolerance. The scene depth is comp_depth
//   (t0) - fresh, engine-truth, already the occlusion guard's source; the
//   fragment's z is SV_Position.z - the exact value this draw is writing;
//   the gradient is ddx/ddy of it, taken pre-branch like the 26277 pair.
//   No epoch ring, no reprojection matrix, no footprint draw, no frozen
//   plane - the witness cannot go stale by construction (one frame late at
//   the injection, the guard's own accepted latency; same-frame at the
//   flush). Verdict: the LIVE stencil counts (t24), read SIGNED, filtered
//   by the 26289 kernel's soft membership - continuous, so no raggedness.
//   CPU picks code 6 only while the snapshot is fresh (< 500 ms); the
