// The last fire cannot be identified while it is happening, so the index is
// LEARNED from the previous frame and self-corrects: a frame that ends with
// no paint at all lowers the target immediately (never below 1), and any
// frame that paints re-learns the target from its own final count. Stable
// fire counts converge to exactly one paint - the last - within a frame.
