// topoFirstSweep 340, pubEarlyFrames 1032 of 1095 - so the provisional fill is
// usually already correct, and the deferred completion then overwrites a good
// vcol with a LATER frame's publish while sm stays at the resolve that
// captured it. The pair ends up one frame apart and wpos -> view -> shadow UV
// is offset by exactly that camera step.
