// signature of a SYSTEMATIC pair mismatch on every seal, not an occasional.
// The error is mine and it is now obvious: sm comes from the ENGINE's resolve,
// so its correct partner is the ENGINE's view for that frame - g_ls.frame_view,
// the published one. g_ro.cycle_pv is the GAME thread snapshot and this file
