// 26179 COMPLETION CENSUS - the instrument 26176/26177 both lacked.
// bandPendConsumed flags the band at CONSUMPTION, which on the model below is
// the one moment nothing is wrong with it. Ordering, dump7 (1657 cycles,
// 70 fps): inject 67, first accept 148, resolves 160, sweeps 235-375, end 377.
