//     3409 - exactly 2 draws after our last fire, on 512 of 512 frames
// So ONLY FIRE 1 CAN EVER LAND INSIDE THE READ WINDOW. Fires 2-9 all sit
// past 2364 by construction. The backstop paints at draw ~3407, roughly a
