// would have failed CLOSED the moment 26251 deleted the snapshots: post_seq
// would stop advancing, every lookup would miss, stenReprojCam.w would sit at
// -1, and the transport would silently run with no reprojection at all - which
// is pre-26234 behaviour and therefore THE STRIP, arriving as a surprise
// regression in the build that was only supposed to delete dead code.
//
// 26249's field dump is what exposed it, and by the accident of a different
// bug: with the post snapshot broken, svReprojEpochMiss read 830 of 830 and the
// strip came back exactly as this would have produced it. The instrument that
