// 26269 THREE DESTINATIONS, FILLED AT THREE DIFFERENT DRAWS.
//
// The first-person sessions read engVerifyFail 955/955 and 711/711 - every copy
// taken at the seam was a worldView, engVerRotMaxDeg 148.7 - while the sweep kept
// finding gate-8 blocks in those same frames (engFpHits 704). A correct view is
// in that buffer; the seam is not when. Slot 0 is still the seam copy, so the
// shipped behaviour is a strict superset of 26268's; slots 1 and 2 are filled
// from the sweep at whatever draws it lands on, and the vertex shader takes the
// first candidate that passes (ledger at KhEngTry).
